  z-double-dot coefficient A = -2*(s + 1)*(3*gt + s - 2)*a(t)**3/(G8*(gt + s)) ;  k^2 z coefficient B = 2*(w + 1)*a(t)/G8
  c_s^2 (omega^2 = c_s^2 k^2/a^2 at large k) = B a^2 / A = -(gt + s)*(w + 1)/((s + 1)*(3*gt + s - 2))
